    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Each grid picture is one mechanical crafter per square. Our parts are drawn as icons; Create parts as letters:$(li)V Item Vault$(li)T Fluid Tank$(li)B Blaze Cake$(li)C Chromatic Compound$(li)R Refined Radiance$(li)S Shadow Steel$(br2)Grey squares are empty.",
