    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Point every crafter's arrow along a chain that ends in one crafter; that one outputs. Crafters only turn from a $(l)cogwheel$() touching one of them, not a shaft behind.$(br2)Mirrored layouts are not accepted.",
